<title>POLAND: PPABANK SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.81 vs    0.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.41 vs    0.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.67 vs    2.19</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.14 vs    2.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.03 vs    2.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.59 vs    4.98</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 29.46 vs   16.66</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	38.94 vs   23.93</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy</p>
<p>Polsko-Amerykaoski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
